Bundled data
------------
data/ema.sqlite3 (shipped in the wheel as ema_rwe/data/ema.sqlite3)
  Derived from the official Studies CSV exports of the HMA-EMA Catalogues of
  real-world data sources and studies, https://catalogues.ema.europa.eu/,
  accessed October 2026 (exports dated 2026-10-01). Contact-person columns
  are not imported.
  Source: European Medicines Agency (EMA). (c) EMA.
  Study records are entered by marketing authorisation holders, researchers
  and institutions; third parties may own copyright in that content. Reuse is
  subject to the EMA legal notices:
    https://catalogues.ema.europa.eu/legal-notice
    https://www.ema.europa.eu/en/about-us/about-website/legal-notice

data/ema-medicines.json (shipped in the wheel as ema_rwe/data/ema-medicines.json)
  EMA medicines data, https://www.ema.europa.eu/, retrieved 2026-09-13.
  Source: European Medicines Agency (EMA). (c) EMA.

tests/fixtures/ema_protocol_cards.html
  Markup excerpt of a study page of https://catalogues.ema.europa.eu/,
  used as a parser test fixture. Source: EMA. (c) EMA.

Study protocols and other documents are not bundled. They are downloaded on
demand to the user's machine; copyright stays with their authors.

